-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON SCOPE AND RESPONSIBILITY

This software is an early-warning aid for crowd density monitoring. It is NOT a
certified safety system and must not be relied upon as the sole means of crowd
safety management at any gathering.

It reports measured crowd density and raises an alert when a configured
threshold is crossed. It does not predict crowd behaviour, and it must always be
used alongside trained human judgement, physical crowd-management measures, and
the applicable regulatory framework.

Any deployment at a public gathering must additionally comply with applicable
law, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023.
